&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backtest, with screenshots and every revert linked: &lt;a href="https://github.com/Maheswar-Sah00/bumpgate/blob/main/backtest/blank-page/RESULTS.md" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://github.com/Maheswar-Sah00/bumpgate/blob/main/backtest/blank-page/RESULTS.md&lt;/a&gt;
